    "detailed_description": "<strong>Once upon a time, there was a legend about this place.</strong><br><br>Retro 2D frame-by-frame hand-drawn animations, carefully selected soundtrack, 2D action game combining exploration, action and adventure elements<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589450/extras/2940c19e4b3fb0a361dba92d29d50e95.avif?t=1727095991\" width=600 height=392 /></span><br><br><strong>Do you have the courage to go through with it?</strong><br><br>Search for hidden secrets in the depths of the Sky City and defeat powerful enemies!<br>Collect ancient scrolls until the end ....<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589450/extras/4ae25300348411e34384c20395048cd0.avif?t=1727095991\" width=600 height=298 /></span><br><br><strong>Discover the best-kept secrets of the monster world</strong><br><br>With each level, the difficulty increases. New monsters are appearing all the time, and the only thing you can rely on is yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589450/extras/27005fcd98eba188f1882aba40c2349d.avif?t=1727095991\" width=600 height=382 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Once upon a time, there was a legend about this place.</strong><br><br>Retro 2D frame-by-frame hand-drawn animations, carefully selected soundtrack, 2D action game combining exploration, action and adventure elements<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589450/extras/2940c19e4b3fb0a361dba92d29d50e95.avif?t=1727095991\" width=600 height=392 /></span><br><br><strong>Do you have the courage to go through with it?</strong><br><br>Search for hidden secrets in the depths of the Sky City and defeat powerful enemies!<br>Collect ancient scrolls until the end ....<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589450/extras/4ae25300348411e34384c20395048cd0.avif?t=1727095991\" width=600 height=298 /></span><br><br><strong>Discover the best-kept secrets of the monster world</strong><br><br>With each level, the difficulty increases. New monsters are appearing all the time, and the only thing you can rely on is yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2589450/extras/27005fcd98eba188f1882aba40c2349d.avif?t=1727095991\" width=600 height=382 /></span>",
